259	**Key principles:**
260	- 12px border radius for premium feel (not 8px)
261	- Light mode emphasizes shadows, dark mode emphasizes borders
262	- Consistent 24px internal padding
263	- Hover states enhance the existing visual style
264	
265	### Chart.js Professional Styling
